Scoped chromanr chroma noise reduction filter

The option table, float threshold storage and truncation, the choice between the
plain and the per-component (_e) slice functions, the clipped and stepped
neighbourhood window, the Manhattan and Euclidean (sqrtf) distances, the rounded
chroma mean and the luma and alpha copies in src/video-ops/chromanr.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_chromanr.c (chromanr_options, pix_fmts, config_input,
filter_frame, FILTER_FUNC manhattan_slice8, euclidean_slice8, manhattan_e_slice8,
euclidean_e_slice8), and the integer, float and constant option parsing follows
libavutil/opt.c (set_string_number, write_number).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
